1
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:15,050
In the beginning, before anything existed, everything was dark and empty.

2
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:19,650
There was no sky, no land, no sea... But God was already there.

3
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:23,750
Then God said, “Let there be light!” And the light appeared!

4
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:29,296
God saw that the light was good. He called the light day, and the darkness night.

5
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:34,150
On the second day, God separated the waters and made the sky, high above.

6
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:38,150
Up above, the blue sky. Down below, the waters of the sea.

7
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:42,847
On the third day, God gathered the waters, and dry land appeared.

8
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:48,171
And from the land grew plants, flowers, and trees full of fruit!

9
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:53,680
On the fourth day, God put the sun in the sky, to shine during the day...

10
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:57,767
...and the moon and the stars, to light up the night.

11
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:05,511
On the fifth day, God filled the waters with fish of every size...

12
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:09,661
...and the sky with little birds that flew and sang.

13
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:16,150
On the sixth day, God made the animals of the land: sheep, rabbits, lions, elephants...

14
00:01:16,300 --> 00:01:22,150
And then God made His most special creation: the man and the woman, Adam and Eve.

15
00:01:22,300 --> 00:01:27,669
God made them to be like Him, to take loving care of everything He had made.

16
00:01:28,100 --> 00:01:32,649
God looked at everything He had made, and saw that it was very good!

17
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:37,659
On the seventh day, God rested, and made that day a special day.

18
00:01:38,100 --> 00:01:42,050
Everything that exists was made by God, with so much love.

19
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:45,308
And do you know who else He made with all His care?

20
00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:47,900
You!

21
00:01:48,300 --> 00:01:53,003
Now talk with your family: which part of creation do you like best?

22
00:01:57,500 --> 00:02:03,297
Subscribe to the channel! Next story: Adam and Eve in the Garden of Eden.

